#   hand band 1: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
#   hand band 8: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
#   hand band 9: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
#   hand band 12: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
#   hand band 12: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
