#   thigh band 4: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
#   thigh band 4: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
#   shin.l band 1: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
#   shin.l band 2: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
#   shin.l band 3: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
#   shin.l band 3: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
#   shin.l band 5: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
#   shin.r band 1: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
